  <content>
    <description>
      <levelledPara>
        <title>General</title>
        <para>Document Core is a Spring Boot application (package <verbatimText>com.officecollab.documentcore</verbatimText>).
          It is the only backend service. Controllers delegate to services; services use Spring Data repositories for
          PostgreSQL and <verbatimText>S3StorageService</verbatimText> for file bytes.</para>
      </levelledPara>
      <levelledPara>
        <title>REST interface</title>
        <table frame="all">
          <title>Endpoints</title>
          <tgroup cols="3">
            <colspec colname="c1"/><colspec colname="c2"/><colspec colname="c3"/>
            <thead><row><entry><para>Method</para></entry><entry><para>Path</para></entry><entry><para>Function</para></entry></row></thead>
            <tbody>
              <row><entry><para>GET</para></entry><entry><para>/api/v1/documents</para></entry><entry><para>List documents.</para></entry></row>
              <row><entry><para>POST</para></entry><entry><para>/api/v1/documents (multipart)</para></entry><entry><para>Upload a file as a new document.</para></entry></row>
              <row><entry><para>POST</para></entry><entry><para>/api/v1/documents/new</para></entry><entry><para>Create a blank docx, xlsx or pptx from a bundled template.</para></entry></row>
              <row><entry><para>GET</para></entry><entry><para>/api/v1/documents/{id}</para></entry><entry><para>Get document detail.</para></entry></row>
              <row><entry><para>PATCH</para></entry><entry><para>/api/v1/documents/{id}</para></entry><entry><para>Rename a document.</para></entry></row>
              <row><entry><para>GET</para></entry><entry><para>/api/v1/documents/{id}/editor-config</para></entry><entry><para>Return the signed ONLYOFFICE editor configuration.</para></entry></row>
              <row><entry><para>GET</para></entry><entry><para>/api/v1/onlyoffice/content</para></entry><entry><para>Serve file bytes to ONLYOFFICE.</para></entry></row>
              <row><entry><para>POST</para></entry><entry><para>/api/v1/onlyoffice/callback</para></entry><entry><para>Receive save notifications from ONLYOFFICE.</para></entry></row>
            </tbody>
          </tgroup>
        </table>
      </levelledPara>
      <levelledPara>
        <title>Internal structure</title>
        <para>Principal classes, by dependency weight from the code graph:
        <sequentialList>
          <listItem><para><verbatimText>DocumentService</verbatimText>: create (upload or template), rename, detail, and editor-config loading. Changing it affects 44 symbols.</para></listItem>
          <listItem><para><verbatimText>OnlyOfficeCallbackService</verbatimText>: processes callback status 2 and 3, downloads the saved file and records a new version.</para></listItem>
          <listItem><para><verbatimText>EditorConfigService</verbatimText> and <verbatimText>OnlyOfficeJwtService</verbatimText>: build and sign the editor configuration; verify inbound callback tokens.</para></listItem>
          <listItem><para><verbatimText>S3StorageService</verbatimText>: put and get objects in the configured bucket.</para></listItem>
        </sequentialList></para>
        <para>No circular imports exist. See <verbatimText>docs/codegraph/CODEGRAPH_REPORT.md</verbatimText> and
          <verbatimText>docs/graphify/GRAPH_REPORT.md</verbatimText>.</para>
      </levelledPara>
      <levelledPara>
        <title>Security</title>
        <para>ONLYOFFICE and Document Core share the secret <verbatimText>ONLYOFFICE_JWT_SECRET</verbatimText>. Editor
          configurations are signed with it and callbacks are verified with it. End users are not authenticated in this build.</para>
      </levelledPara>
    </description>
